{"page": 2, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Processes / Algorithms / Pathways", "rects": [[62.25, 56.244232177734375, 299.8501281738281, 69.8402328491211]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0000.wav", "duration": 3.125}, {"index": 1, "text": "Insertion Sort (introduced conceptually)", "rects": [[62.25, 86.47245025634766, 301.2774353027344, 97.75653076171875]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0001.wav", "duration": 3.2}, {"index": 2, "text": "Goal: Sort a sequence of numbers into monotonically\nincreasing order.\nComplexity: Time roughly c1\u00b7n\u00b2 for n items (proportional to\nn\u00b2).\nKey insight: Insertion sort typically has a smaller constant\nfactor than merge sort.", "rects": [[92.25, 114.38660430908203, 459.4546813964844, 127.98260498046875], [92.25, 127.9803466796875, 214.6500701904297, 141.57635498046875], [92.25, 141.5740966796875, 517.0615234375, 155.17010498046875], [92.25, 155.1678466796875, 121.05001068115234, 168.76385498046875], [92.25, 168.7615966796875, 524.2626953125, 182.35760498046875], [92.25, 182.3553466796875, 257.85009765625, 195.95135498046875]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0002.wav", "duration": 18.525}, {"index": 3, "text": "Merge Sort (introduced conceptually)", "rects": [[62.25, 212.58358764648438, 277.3746643066406, 223.86766052246094]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0003.wav", "duration": 2.825}, {"index": 4, "text": "Goal: Sort a sequence of numbers into monotonically\nincreasing order. Complexity: Time roughly c2\u00b7n\u00b7lg n (proportional to n\u00b7lg n,\nwhere lg n = log\u21d4 n). Key insight: Merge sort\u2019s advantage of lg n versus n more\nthan compensates for difference in constant factors once n\nbecomes large enough.", "rects": [[92.25, 240.4977264404297, 459.4546813964844, 254.09373474121094], [92.25, 254.09146118164062, 214.6500701904297, 267.6874694824219], [92.25, 267.6852111816406, 517.0615234375, 2