ents: Hardware design, GUIs,\nobject-oriented systems, web technologies, networking,\nmachine learning \u2014 all rely on algorithms at their core.", "rects": [[92.25, 503.5114440917969, 502.6732482910156, 517.107421875], [92.25, 517.105224609375, 365.8501892089844, 530.701171875], [92.25, 530.698974609375, 488.2861328125, 544.294921875], [92.25, 544.292724609375, 481.0499572753906, 557.888671875], [92.25, 557.886474609375, 495.4499206542969, 571.482421875]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0008.wav", "duration": 19.325}, {"index": 9, "text": "Comparisons & Trade-offs", "rects": [[62.25, 587.4403076171875, 235.05007934570312, 601.0362548828125]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/27243751/pages/2/audio/seg_0009.wav", "duration": 2.1}, {"index": 10, "text": "Dimension\nInsertion Sort\nMerge Sort\nRunning time ~c\u21d4\u00b7n\u00b2\n~c\u21d4\u00b7n\u00b7lg n\nConstant\nfactor\nTypically smaller (c\u21d4 < c\u21d4)\nTypically larger (c\u21d4\n> c\u21d4)\nAdvantage\nSmall input sizes\nLarge input sizes", "rects": [[64.5, 619.2440185546875, 129.30001831054688, 632.8399658203125], [159.40672302246094, 619.2440185546875, 260.206787109375, 632.8399658203125], [380.7622985839844, 619.2440185546875, 452.7621765136719, 632.8399658203125], [64.5, 635.8377685546875, 202.90673828125, 649.4337158203125], [380.7622985839844, 635.8377685546875, 453.06219482421875, 649.4337158203125], [64.5, 652.4315185546875, 122.10000610351562, 666.0274658203125], [64.5, 666.0252685546875, 107.69999694824219, 679.6212158203125], [159.40672302246094, 659.2283935546875, 354.4068603515625, 672.8243408203125], [380.7622985839844, 652.4315185546875, 525.06201171875, 666.0274658203125], [380.7622985839844, 666.0252685546875, 417.0622863769531, 679.6212158203125], [64.5, 682.6190185546875, 129.30001831054688, 696.2149658203125], [159.40672302246094, 682.6190185546875, 281.80682373046875, 696.2149658203125], [380.7622985839844, 682.6190185546875, 503.16204833984375, 696.2149658203125